# Drop RNNoise .rnnn model files here.
#
# The sidecar resolves the active model in this order:
#   1. --model <path>           explicit override
#   2. RNNOISE_MODEL env var    user override
#   3. UCX_MODEL_DIR/rnnoise/   shared model cache (set by SidecarRunner)
#   4. tools/rnnoise/models/    this directory (preferred for shipped builds)
#
# Filename convention: cb.rnnn is the default broadband model picked
# automatically when present.
#
# Vetted sources:
#   - github.com/GregorR/rnnoise-models   community-trained models, MIT
#   - github.com/xiph/rnnoise             upstream training data + tooling
#
# Models are intentionally NOT vendored (license + size) — fetch separately.
